<title>CANADA: Corriente buys Peru gold property option.</title>
<headline>Corriente buys Peru gold property option.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corriente Resources Inc said on Friday it has acquired an option to buy a 100 percent interest in a gold project in Peru.</p>
<p>The company said the Chama property is in southern Peru, 250 kilometres northwest of Arequipa.</p>
<p>The option agreement requires Corriente to pay C$1.2 million in cash over three years, the company said.</p>
<p>Corriente said it believes the property contains encouraging gold and silver values. The company said it has taken 29 representative rock samples of an extensive silica zone on the property.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
